<title>USA: TriNet's 6 mln shrs prices at $33.625/shr.</title>
<headline>TriNet's 6 mln shrs prices at $33.625/shr.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>TriNet Corporate Realty Trust Inc said on Tuesday that its six million share stock offering priced at $33.625/shr.</p>
<p>Proceeds, which will total $190.2 million, will be used to reduce its revolving acquisition credit facility and to fund new acquisitions, TriNet said.</p>
<p>After closing of the offering, TriNet will have 19,986,667 shares outstanding.  </p>
<p>TriNet said Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, Merrill Lynch &amp; Co, J.P. Morgan &amp; Co and Smith Barney Inc are managing underwriters for the offering.</p>
</text>
